1
00:00:00,150 --> 00:00:05,850
At Lighthaven's frozen edge, a merciless blizzard swallows Elwin Village as shadow cavalry approach.

2
00:00:06,150 --> 00:00:11,850
Hidden in a quiet tavern, two fallen Holy Knights await the birth of their firstborn sons.

3
00:00:12,150 --> 00:00:17,850
Suddenly, the heavy pine door groaned on its iron hinges and burst open.

4
00:00:18,150 --> 00:00:23,850
In the span of a single heartbeat, the tip of Balian's arcane spear hissed.

5
00:00:24,150 --> 00:00:29,850
[Balian] If you are a hound of the Shadow Realm, speak your name and die!

6
00:00:30,150 --> 00:00:35,850
[Hercul] Stand down, brothers. I bear wolf blood, yet I do not hunt for the pack.

7
00:00:36,150 --> 00:00:41,850
A dome of golden protective aegis blossomed outward, muffling the roar of the exterior.

8
00:00:42,150 --> 00:00:47,850
As the tension subsided, Hercul swallowed a stale crust of bread and laid bare.

9
00:00:48,150 --> 00:00:53,850
[Hercul] The shadow reaches this basin. Royal inquisitors will strike before the new moon.

10
00:00:54,150 --> 00:00:59,850
Before stepping back into the blizzard, Hercul produced two slender silver daggers wrapped in.

11
00:01:00,150 --> 00:01:05,850
[Hercul] Place these silver daggers in your sons' hands to discern brother from foe.

12
00:01:06,150 --> 00:01:11,850
[Aleksandar] If my son is born, I shall name him Kadan—the unbreakable shield.

13
00:01:12,150 --> 00:01:17,850
[Balian] And mine shall be named Ignis, whose spirit will never lose its way.

14
00:01:18,150 --> 00:01:23,850
Raising cups filled not with wine but with melted snowfall, the three warriors consecrated.

15
00:01:24,150 --> 00:01:29,850
Three mornings later, the treacherous highborn Lucian sets his covetous eyes upon Elwin.

16
00:01:30,150 --> 00:01:35,850
At dawn, iron-clad legionnaires encircled the village under cover of burning pitch.

17
00:01:36,150 --> 00:01:41,850
[Lucian] Surrender your steel, Aleksandar, and confess before the imperial vanguard!

18
00:01:42,150 --> 00:01:47,850
[Aleksandar] My wife's life is not a favor to barter from a traitor's tongue!

19
00:01:48,150 --> 00:01:53,850
With a thunderous cry, Aleksandar severed the massive mooring cables supporting the span.

20
00:01:54,150 --> 00:01:59,850
[Ysela] Lay no hand upon me, monster!

21
00:02:00,150 --> 00:02:05,850
[Balian] Live, Ysela! You must live!

22
00:02:06,150 --> 00:02:11,850
Snapping his arcane spear haft, Balian holds the canyon cliffside against the imperial vanguard.

23
00:02:12,150 --> 00:02:17,850
On the ruined bridge, Aleksandar broke his twin swords across the breastplate of the.

24
00:02:18,150 --> 00:02:23,850
Reaching the frozen tundra, Elwin dropped to her knees, looking back toward the pillars.

25
00:02:24,150 --> 00:02:29,850
Clutching the silver dagger, Elwin buries golden wheat seeds into the frozen earth and flees north.

26
00:02:30,150 --> 00:02:35,850
[Elwin] Even if we never return, someone must live to bake bread here again.

27
00:02:36,150 --> 00:02:41,850
[Elwin] My child, reject vengeance—only promise never to bow your head before a lie.

28
00:02:42,150 --> 00:02:47,850
Though the blizzard buries their blood, the twin silver daggers glow like an unquenchable ember.
